  Flag names and pflag value types from the flag registrations of:
    kubectl and cli-runtime 1.36 (Copyright The Kubernetes Authors, Apache-2.0)
    Helm 4.3.1 and 3.21.1 (Copyright The Helm Authors, Apache-2.0)
